{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>筲箕灣發生火警。今日（28日）凌晨1時54分，消防接報指，愛禮街2號屋苑「愛蝶灣」第4座一個低層單位的睡房起火，一人報稱被困，需要消防協助疏散，同時多人報案。消防接報到場開喉撲救，同日凌晨2時16分將火撲熄。</p><p>事件中，一名火場男戶主背部受到輕微燒傷，清醒由救護車送往東區醫院接受治理，另有一名男居民受輕傷，登上救護車接受檢查，大約300人需要疏散。</p><p>就現場所見，許多居民身穿睡衣或家居服下樓暫避，有老婦需坐輪椅。</p><p>據了解，起火單位住有一男一女，懷疑床上拖板過熱起火，女戶主見狀立即離開單位，鄰近單位一名男住戶逃生時撞傷手部。</p><figure><img alt=\"愛禮街2號屋苑「愛蝶灣」第4座一個低層單位的睡房起火。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261128/1203181470676422656397158.jpeg/W2EbHTFWzCNfimFtcBXXDmvn6mrycmGuP7S8XAW0vFw\"/><figcaption>愛禮街2號屋苑「愛蝶灣」第4座一個低層單位的睡房起火。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一名男居民感到不適，登上救護車接受檢查。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261128/1203180189962997760675143.jpeg/gCtrZ8mnP9qyzV0C_kktQkgZCjrzx0MfE3ZGFyl2Rhc\"/><figcaption>一名男居民感到不適，登上救護車接受檢查。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"老婦需坐輪椅下樓暫避。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261128/1203180187026853888825034.jpeg/jj-gvzPh2Z-aVdorxv5ok0xUwTEI2M-MGtcpUyDXKVM\"/><figcaption>老婦需坐輪椅下樓暫避。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大約300人需要疏散。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261128/1203180177949986816874601.jpeg/GIQV7DUx7IoyQCcNlUa_kXj_XkoqJZVh6suPNtDLjzY\"/><figcaption>大約300人需要疏散。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防和警員到場。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261128/1203180170932916224962405.jpeg/5ipHdQe4Lajy4Kv2dWt65U8FG6wgH28f-etW0sPrVtI\"/><figcaption>消防和警員到場。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261128/1203180183952297984174039.jpeg/D_AjT3swVMiNke0C_Zrzo387JAB0q9P6x89MCv3PTAo\"/><figcaption>消防到場。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T19:24:37.247167+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":350,"images":6,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T19:00:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T19:37:48.227838+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T19:17:54.924209+00:00","content_hash":"ae771ec28b7bffc91f2cd31df820772ee08054cc599b2c442660e246ae0afb87","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}